{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽说是第一天，但今天的考试已经结束了。", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "路上碰到的人也都是松了一口气的表情。", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们可能也差不多。", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃考得怎么样？」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉应该还行吧」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3431", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是你」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「倒也不是，挺勉强的」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3432", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以，实际考得怎么样？」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「应该不会让爱理生气」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3433", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「听到这个我就放心了」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥考得如何？」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3434", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟你一样」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜～好羡慕你们俩～」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3592", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁考得……嗯，看你这表情我就懂了」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": "「安洁考得……嗯，看你这表情我就懂了」", "plain_idx": 176, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「神明大人一定讨厌女仆！」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3593", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都不肯对安洁致以微笑」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3594", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是因为你没努力到最后吗？」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2194", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「努力了，我已经燃尽了」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3595", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「上次是勉强合格了吧？」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1146", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，但这次是非常危险，在出结果前不能有丝毫松懈」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "「嗯，但这次是非常危险，在出结果前不能有丝毫松懈」", "plain_idx": 189, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3596", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的结果已经定下来了啊……", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「现在还是调整下心态，准备明天的考试吧」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "「现在还是调整下心态，准备明天的考试吧」", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，心态很重要」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2195", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是想象输给我的瓜生臣服的表情，就有动力学习了」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": "「只是想象输给我的瓜生臣服的表情，就有动力学习了」", "plain_idx": 195, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2196", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你居然在想那种事……」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥要不要先练习一下臣服？」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3435", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为了不变成那样，明天的考试也要加油」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁、安洁已经……想要去某个遥远的地方旅行了！」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "「安洁、安洁已经……想要去某个遥远的地方旅行了！」", "plain_idx": 201, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3597", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那样的话，回来会有补考」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3436", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜哇，对哦，从现在开始安洁也得努力」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": "「呜哇，对哦，从现在开始安洁也得努力」", "plain_idx": 205, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3598", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，明天还……」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然感受到了视线。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "悄悄瞟了一眼，有几个女生在看向这边。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": "悄悄瞟了一眼，有几个女生在看向这边。", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……是我不认识的女生。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎么回事。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉她们是有点好奇……但还是很奇怪。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "感觉她们是有点好奇……但还是很奇怪。", "plain_idx": 213, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且她们，似乎是在看我……和樱乃？", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃，那几个女生你认识吗？」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没，不认识」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3437", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "注意到我们的视线后，女生们慌忙离开。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "注意到我们的视线后，女生们慌忙离开。", "plain_idx": 218, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1147", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……没什么」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻摇头。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那些离开的女生们的表情，那笑容似乎带些深意……", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "那些离开的女生们的表情，那笑容似乎带些深意……", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是我想多了吧。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥，你担心考试吗？」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3438", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟才刚开始」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻把手放到樱乃头上。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，不过肯定没事的」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3439", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我点了头，但还是有点在意。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为什么呢。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然跟刚并校的时候不同——", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "虽然跟刚并校的时候不同——", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我有种，学校内空气变浑浊的感觉。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
